  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Africa Energy Infrastructure Event Series, through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting the South Africa Energy Infrastructure Event Series consisting of two Reverse Trade Missions and two workshops. The Event Series will promote cooperation on energy projects between the public and private sectors in the United States and South Africa and aim to further the likelihood that energy projects in South Africa are implemented utilizing U.S. goods and services.</narrative>
  </description>
